IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0026.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0026C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 DECISION-CD        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
    05 DECLINE-RSN        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2500-BK-RULES
    DISPLAY "DECISION-CD=" DECISION-CD
    DISPLAY "DECLINE-RSN=" DECLINE-RSN
    STOP RUN.
2500-BK-RULES.
    IF IN-BKRPT-IND = 'Y'
        IF IN-YRS-SINCE-BK < 5
            MOVE 'D' TO DECISION-CD
            MOVE 'BK1' TO DECLINE-RSN
        ELSE
            MOVE 'R' TO DECISION-CD
            MOVE 'BK2' TO DECLINE-RSN
        END-IF
    END-IF.
